hadiths[4]{hadithnumber,text}:
"15850","Yazid narrated to us, he said: Muhammad ibn Ishaq narrated to us, from Muhammad ibn Ibrahim al-Taymi, from Said ibn al-Musayyab, from Mamar ibn Abdullah ibn Nadlah al-Qurashi, he said: I heard the Messenger of Allah, peace and blessings of Allah be upon him, say: None hoards but the sinner."
"15851","Abdah ibn Sulayman narrated to us, he said: Muhammad ibn Ishaq narrated to us, from Muhammad ibn Ibrahim, from Said ibn al-Musayyab, from Mamar ibn Abdullah al-Adawi, he said: The Messenger of Allah, peace and blessings of Allah be upon him, said: None hoards but the sinner."
"15852","Muhammad ibn Jafar narrated to us: Shubah narrated to us, from Muhammad ibn Ishaq, from Muhammad ibn Ibrahim al-Taymi, from Said ibn al-Musayyab, from Mamar, a man of Quraysh, he said: The Messenger of Allah, peace and blessings of Allah be upon him, said: None hoards but the sinner."
"15853","Yahya ibn Said al-Umawi narrated to us, he said: Yahya ibn Said narrated to us, from Said ibn al-Musayyab, from Mamar al-Adawi, he said: The Messenger of Allah, peace and blessings of Allah be upon him, said: None hoards but the sinner. And Said ibn al-Musayyab used to hoard oil."
